    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/17/Hakufu_Sonsaku_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251015232050\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"581\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Hakufu_Sonsaku_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/17/Hakufu_Sonsaku_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251015232050\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eNanyou Little Conqueror\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\"\u003eAppearance\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHakufu_Sonsaku%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eHakufu\u003c/b\u003e is a beautiful girl with a voluptuous body. She has long flowing, beautiful strawberry blonde hair that goes down all the way to her back which also covers her ears. Her hair also has bangs as well, most of which is in the middle of her forehead which covers up most of her forehead. Two strands of Hakufu\u0027s hair also stick out on the top of her head.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eHakufu\u003c/b\u003e is usually seen in her \u003cb\u003eNanyo Academy\u003c/b\u003e uniform which consists of a red plaid skirt, a yellow sweater vest with a white collared shirt underneath, white socks and a pair of brown loafers.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\"\u003ePersonality\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHakufu_Sonsaku%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eHakufu\u003c/b\u003e is usually a nice person but is prone to extreme fits of anger like a kid when she doesn\u0027t get her way. She is also a very headstrong person who will go into any situation or battle without thinking, exposing herself to severe danger. She also behaves like a typical \"brainless beauty\" sometimes, showing moments of low intelligence and complete lack of common sense - such as extreme naivety towards others\u0027 true intentions, or the inability to \"see the bigger picture\" around her.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eHakufu\u003c/b\u003e enjoys fighting, but she is adamantly against the idea of killing or using deliberate violence on her opponents. Despite her destiny to conquer all the schools, Hakufu just wants to fight. Basically speaking, she fights for the sake of fighting.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Hakufu_Sonsaku_Little_Conqueror_of_Nanyo_S_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:75px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Hakufu_Sonsaku_Little_Conqueror_of_Nanyo_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Little Conqueror of Nanyo S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (251 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:75px;\"\u003e\u003cnoscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/11/Hakufu_Sonsaku_Little_Conqueror_of_Nanyo_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20251015233905\" title=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Little Conqueror of Nanyo S Queen\u0026#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (251 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Hakufu Sonsaku Little Conquero